71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6iJFim43k9wQ7kNvwHqvszX&_nc_oc=AdpRDVWu0n5w3bPxWm7Tkd2Cxpam15BLVOcjEHSBIUkU3wepwU394xMeFBlOC28pg6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGPpwoJjNNyVuPeSrxagVzg_Xc4SmqnLLvQrlZd-XOd3Q&oe=6A942BB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mh9Hb8bcweQQ7kNvwG14BGn&_nc_oc=Adrd2DrZSfARtoEpCrpjTa3RE3n49offJZtVqLkS9rFaprFwdJU67CG7QPw9zrqNI4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF6nF3D7VujuF8b2Z3mbOGEMIiBD6EsuNiJO-N9spKDuA&oe=6A940653"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b9iArPyGDF4Q7kNvwGWd_QY&_nc_oc=Adq-v11_yGIl1zXAlCGkl3flbIXCZOcUbuoJDfEjgKI1tXNr4-nH4ZTOS3D9O8nNAjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHmz9m9Cuug15mWmW8xaXFSZ968apKkhP5Gm9LTCX7VSw&oe=6A94049A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: